# MyPowerPlant theme

Household VPP advisory. Brand feel: calm, editorial, trustworthy — personal-finance app, not a SaaS dashboard. Warm and human.

Use CSS tokens from `frontend/src/styles/tokens.css`. Do not invent a second palette or type scale. Do not hardcode hex in components.

## Colour families

- **Eucalypt** (`--euc-*`, `--structure`, `--surplus`): structure, trust, surplus, dark bands, sidebar, icon tiles.
- **Terracotta** (`--terra-*`, `--primary`, `--deficit`): action and attention only — primary CTAs, active nav bar, negative currency, chart series 2, forecast peak. Not decorative.
- **Warm neutrals** (`--canvas`, `--surface`, `--surface-sunken`, `--border`): page and cards. Never fill a full-width band with `--euc-50` / `--euc-100`.
- **Deep band** (`--surface-deep` + `--on-deep` / `--on-deep-muted`): hero and “Why we built MyPowerPlant” only.

## Type

- Headings (H1/H2, hero): `--font-display` (Lora). Regular/medium, generous line-height. Never sans for large headings.
- Body, labels, buttons, nav, inputs: `--font-body` (Inter). Regular body; medium/semibold labels and buttons. Never serif for UI text.
- Eyebrow labels (`STEP 3 OF 5`, `ESTIMATED EARNINGS`): sans, uppercase, letter-spaced, `--ink-muted` (or `--on-deep-muted` on deep bands).

## Shape

- Primary/secondary buttons: fully rounded pills. Primary = `--primary` fill, `--on-primary` text, `--primary-hover` on hover. Secondary = `--surface` + `--euc-800` border + `--ink` text.
- Text links: underlined, `--ink-secondary` (or `--on-deep` with `--euc-400` underline on deep bands).
- Inputs, cards, toggles: 8–12px radius. Shadows only if existing screens use them — then soft and low-opacity.
- No heavy shadows, gradients, or glassmorphism. No blue/indigo/purple palette.

## Layout (logged-in)

- Dark ~60–70px icon-only left rail (`--euc-900`; inactive `--euc-200`; active `--euc-800` + white label + 3px `--terra-600` left bar) + location near the bottom. Header: terracotta lightning-badge + “MyPowerPlant” wordmark + location pill. Repeat on every logged-in screen.
- Content: generous whitespace, left-aligned constrained column; supporting cards to the right on wide desktop (Welcome: copy left, earnings card right).
- Mobile: reviewed frames drop the sidebar. Do not invent a tab bar or drawer — confirm with design first.
- Icons: simple line/duotone, not filled illustration.

## Product rules

- Copy: plain-language, second person, short sentences. Explain energy jargon. Placeholder copy must match this tone.
- Every number must visually distinguish **estimate** vs **verified fact** (e.g. “Estimated earnings” vs “Verified for Kew”). Estimate pills use `--surface-sunken` + `--ink-secondary` — never an accent colour.
